WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:04.480
<i>The Great Jahy is the Dark Realm's
second-in-command,</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.440
<i>and she is most proud!</i>

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:07.590
O Great Jahy! O Great Jahy!

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.360
O Great Jahy!

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.620
<i>Noble!</i>

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:15.600
<i>Beautiful!</i>

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:17.780
Hey, you.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.290
Where do you think you're looking?

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.380
What? Is that defiance I see?

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.160
D-Defiance from me? Never!

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:32.620
What? You dare talk back to me?

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.800
I-I beg your forgiveness, O Great Jahy!

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.300
Forgive me!

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:48.770
<i>Feared across the Dark Realm, 
she is revered by all!</i>

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.400
<i>Or she </i>was<i>!</i>

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:53.490
Come on in!

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.360
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.150
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:10.940
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:11.650
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:12.440
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.390
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:27.750
Craft Pub
<b>Maou.</b>

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.440
Thank you for waiting!

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:33.040
<b>Restoration Plan No. 3

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.140
What's going on today?

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:33.210
I feel more nimble than usual.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.140
<i>Go on, revere and admire me.</i>

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:49.100
I've never seen a mana 
crystal this big before!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.390
Right?

00:02:50.390 --> 00:02:54.480
From now on, please allow me to call you
 Your Greatness instead of Hy-chan!

00:02:57.330 --> 00:02:58.410
Hy-chan?

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.940
What's this? What happened 
to "Your Greatness"?

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:02.320
That thing on your chest...

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.530
Oh, this?

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.540
It's no big deal, you know?

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.330
I finally managed to get
 my hands on it myself...

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.300
My first step to restoring the Dark Realm.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:15.680
It's dangerous because it just gets 
in the way. Please go drop it off at home.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.960
What?!

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:20.170
You're right, b-but you've got it all wrong!

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.940
My power comes from mana crystals.

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:27.350
With one this big, I shan't return
to that kiddie form again!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:28.890
How awesome is that?

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:30.100
You don't say.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.730
What is that supposed to mean?!

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:32.550
Woman!

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:34.620
Do you not understand how incredible it is

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:37.950
to have a mana crystal of this size?

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:39.760
With... one this big...

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:42.330
I can work until last call!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.990
Wow, really?

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:47.370
Then maybe I'll ask you to tough 
it out until the end today.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:48.740
Just leave it to me.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.160
It'll be nothing!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:11.390
Huh?

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:14.240
<i>Why am I even working?</i>

00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:17.980
<i>Did I maintain this form so I could work?</i>

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:20.820
<i>No... I didn't!</i>

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:24.280
<i>I haven't been searching for 
mana crystals for </i>this<i>!</i>

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.820
<i>It was so I could rebuild the Dark Realm!</i>

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.930
<i>That's what all my hard work has been for!</i>

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:32.500
Having you around
 until last call was a big help.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.710
Your mana crystal really is something.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.580
It really is!

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.440
I could do this in my sleep!

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:42.630
In fact, I could even keep working!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.130
Right now, I could do anything!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:48.850
And it's all thanks to getting
 my hands on this giant mana crystal.

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:51.310
Anything, really? Wow...

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:54.440
Could you get that slimy gunk
 out of the drain?

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.270
What?!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:58.580
I knew it. Not even a mana 
crystal could fix that.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:05:00.870
I just can't seem to get rid of it...

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.480
There is nothing my mana crystal cannot do!

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:10.410
Amazing! That pesky gunk is 
fading away before my eyes!

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.380
Next, there's that grease on the stove hood.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.790
I got it!

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:17.330
What do you think of my
mana crystal's power now?!

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:19.000
Just amazing!

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:21.200
What about the cigarette smell?

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.170
Consider it expunged!

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.020
And the trays that are all sticky from beer?

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.050
Fresh and clean!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.970
I'm not here to fix everything for you!

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.930
Don't make me use my mana crystal
 for such trivial things!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.100
I'm sorry.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.810
We've just been so understaffed and 
I couldn't get any of this done.

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.020
Hire more people! Hire more!

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:40.890
All right, listen well.

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:44.830
Mana crystals are my last 
remaining tie to the Dark Lord.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:51.120
My goal is to gather them up 
and restore the Dark Realm.

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:57.530
They can do far more than maintain 
this form or clean the ventilator hood.

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:59.510
They can be used to hurt people, too.

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:04.200
You had best not anger me
if you know what's good for you.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.290
Oh, no! I'm back in kiddie form!

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:11.260
Are you telling me... 
its magic power ran out?

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:15.530
Already? Even with a mana crystal this size?

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:18.130
This is your fault!

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:20.780
It's because you made me do 
all that pointless stuff!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.160
I'm very sorry, Hy-chan.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:27.780
But I love it when you're small.
 You're so adorable.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:29.240
How dare you?!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.740
I like you when you're big, too, of course.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.490
That's not the point!

00:06:33.920 --> 00:06:38.090
Oh, wait, you can't go home alone
at this hour looking like that.

00:06:38.090 --> 00:06:40.350
I'll take you, okay?

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.710
Do not treat me like a child!

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.420
<i>This sucks.</i>

00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:51.120
<i>She doesn't understand how amazing this
 mana crystal is, or how magnificent I am!</i>

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.640
<i>How depressing...</i>

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.150
<i>Wait, there's </i>her<i>!</i>

00:06:57.260 --> 00:07:00.770
An invitation to tea from 
the Great Jahy is such an honor!

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:04.860
And you even came to my place to get me!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:08.280
Yes, well, I was feeling generous.

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.890
So, how have you been doing?

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:13.770
How's the mana crystal 
collecting coming along?

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:18.290
To be honest, it's not going so well...

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:23.000
I see. Well, I suppose I 
could say I'm doing all right.

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:26.090
Your Greatness, that mana crystal...

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:26.900
<i>Finally!</i>

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.560
It's so big and spectacular!

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.130
I'd expect no less from you.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:36.100
<i>This is it! This is what 
I've been waiting for!</i>

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:39.900
One that large must hold 
a considerable amount of power.

00:07:39.900 --> 00:07:40.840
Yes, indeed.

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.560
I didn't know there were 
still mana crystals so big!

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:46.580
Attaining it must have been quite an ordeal.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:49.230
An ordeal? Please, you must be joking.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:54.060
As if such a thing would be difficult
for the Dark Realm's second-in-command!

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:55.370
You're outstanding!

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:01.050
It may have been an ordeal for <i>you</i>, 
but for me, it was child's play.

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:04.720
All hail the Great Jahy,
second-in-command of the Dark Realm!

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:06.920
Actually, now that the Dark Realm
 has been destroyed...

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.230
I believe you must be the top dog!

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:12.880
I am in such awe of you!

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:16.290
<i>Yes! She's saying everything I wanted to hear!</i>

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.600
<i>This is the absolute best!</i>

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:23.190
By the way, where did you 
find that mana crystal?

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:27.230
Well, you know... it was...

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:32.570
<i>I can't tell her I found it hills nearby. 
That's so underwhelming.</i>

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:37.240
That day, I sensed a faint 
trace of magical power.

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:40.490
It lead me to a deep forest far from here.

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:41.750
Don't tell me!

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:46.400
You mean the Sea of Trees, 
from which no man leaves alive?!

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:47.710
<i>The what? Where?</i>

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:51.490
Th-That was just the place! 
The Sea of Something-or-Other...

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:54.550
<i>In reality, it was just that
 practically barren little mountain.</i>

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:56.020
I knew it.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:09:00.010
I still haven't managed to set foot
 in those uncharted lands.

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:03.260
There, I was attacked 
by a huge, monstrous bird,

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:05.660
the likes of which you'd 
never see in the Dark Realm.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:06.730
I can't believe it!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:09.400
You braved such peril!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.570
<i>Well, by "monstrous bird," 
I really mean a crow.</i>

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.350
And here I was, carelessly and 
completely ignorant of all this...

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.390
Bad Druj! Bad! Bad, bad, bad!

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.660
Nevertheless, I...

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.250
You defeated it?!

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:31.650
How I would've loved to be there 
and behold your victory!

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:34.450
I apologize.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:39.090
You needn't say a word.
 I understand perfectly.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:41.300
You must have killed it 
in such a gruesome manner

00:09:41.300 --> 00:09:44.290
that its remains were 
completely unrecognizable!

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:46.780
<i>Your imagination is what's gruesome.</i>

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:50.360
However, there wasn't just one of those birds!

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.470
The beast had its loathsome brood with it.

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:59.540
And I exterminated every last one of them!

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.370
<i>I will save you!</i>

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:04.670
How wonderfully brutal!

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:07.540
That is how the the Great Jahy
 of the Dark Realm does it!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.490
How all demons should!

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:12.210
I just can't stop tingling!

00:10:12.550 --> 00:10:14.920
<i>I might have overshot on this one.</i>

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:18.900
If only I could have recorded you in action!

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:22.140
You must have been a fearsome sight!

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.770
<i>I'd never let anyone record that!</i>

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:28.590
Well, anyway, when I inspected
the bird's nest afterward,

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:31.730
I found this huge mana crystal in it.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:34.520
Incredible!

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:37.070
<i>I exaggerated quite a bit,</i>

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:41.050
<i>but it looks like Druj is 
plenty convinced, so whatever.</i>

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:44.580
I see. So that's just a small piece of it.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:48.330
The one you acquired
 must have been even larger.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:53.390
After all, it came from the nest of a bird
bigger than any monster in the Dark Realm.

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:58.060
Even a peon like me can tell 
it must be too large to haul around.

00:10:58.340 --> 00:10:58.840
Huh?

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:02.450
We're that much closer to 
restoring the Dark Realm now!

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:04.050
I knew you could do it, Your Greatness!

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:05.420
Y-Yeah...

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.770
<i>This is the only haul I got...</i>

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.280
I'm a bit relieved now.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:16.480
When I saw that your form had 
changed here in the human world,

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:21.550
I was a little worried that
 you may have changed inside, as well...

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.390
But after hearing your story today,

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:31.640
I'm sure now that the cruel, ruthless
Great Jahy is alive and well.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:33.920
It's only affirmed for me...

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:38.260
that you truly are a paragon
 for all the Dark Realm.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.010
<b>PANG</b>

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:46.150
Compared to you, I haven't collected 
nearly enough mana crystals yet.

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:49.900
Is that so? It seems to me
 that you're working hard.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.730
What a kind thing to say!

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:56.440
Well, I wouldn't mind giving you some advice.

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:57.790
Really?!

00:11:57.790 --> 00:12:02.820
I've collected so little compared 
to you, so it's embarrassing.

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:06.070
I've only gathered 
a single truckload this month.

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:08.290
<i>A whole truckload?!</i>

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:12.160
At this rate, reviving the Dark Realm 
is but a dream within a dream!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:16.740
So you have more than the ones
 on display at your place?

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:20.850
Oh, I like the look of those,
so I use them as decorations.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:22.220
Decorations?!

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:29.390
Y-Your Greatness?

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:33.270
<i>And here I was, rejoicing over 
this tiny, pathetic crystal...</i>

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:36.000
Your Greatness?!

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.700
I-I'm so sorry!

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:42.070
Because of my incompetence, I've only 
collected this puny amount of mana crystals.

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:43.820
Your Greatness!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.630
Direct your wrath at me! Please! I need it!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:49.490
<b>Open</b>

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:52.770
Why am I even doing this?

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:55.090
Your Greatness?

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:03.510
May I ask what you are 
doing in a place like this?

00:13:07.190 --> 00:13:08.470
<i>Druj?!</i>

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.310
<i>Why is she here?!</i>

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.770
<i>She's the one person 
who should never see this!</i>

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:20.980
<i>I, the Great Jahy, overlord of all the
 Dark Realm, am now working for a human.</i>

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:23.240
<i>She absolutely, positively cannot see this!</i>

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:26.550
Oh? I see you're wearing an apron today.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:30.370
Pub... Maou?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.910
Don't tell me...

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:35.740
Indeed. This is my place.

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.000
I knew it!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.680
So you're running a gastronomy business.

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:42.840
Well, this is just a small part.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:46.540
Honestly, I wouldn't bother 
with such a rundown place,

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:49.900
but it's all to gather information 
about mana crystals.

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:56.910
Additionally, this is a way 
to take money from the humans.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:00.550
<i>Ugh, I keep talking without thinking first!</i>

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:03.250
You are beyond compare, Your Greatness!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:09.600
You plan not only to lord over the 
Dark Realm, but the human world, as well!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.050
W-Well, something like that.

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:14.830
<i>I need to get her away from here posthaste.</i>

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:19.450
Your Greatness, please allow me to study 
the inner workings of this place!

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:25.510
I-It's a real shame, but we're closed today.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:26.980
Closed?

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.450
But you can come by some other day!

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:31.470
<i>Preferably never!</i>

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:33.160
Oh?

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:34.290
Do we have a customer?

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:35.680
Please come in!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.640
<i>Why did you come out?!</i>

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.670
Oh, no, I'm just...

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:42.730
Oh, are you one of Hy-chan's friends?

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:45.230
"Hy-chan"?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.120
Druj, control your powers!

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:55.040
But she called you, the Great Jahy...

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:58.630
My name is just too flashy 
here in the human world.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:02.290
I ordered her to call me Hy-chan here.

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:03.920
I-I see.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.730
Do pardon me. My name is Dojima.

00:15:06.730 --> 00:15:09.780
I am a former underling 
of the Great... Hy-chan.

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:12.010
My, how polite.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.760
I happen to be the own—

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:15.060
An employee!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:18.770
Because no matter how you look at her,
 she's obviously an employee!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.730
What's the matter, Hy-chan?

00:15:20.880 --> 00:15:25.940
Please! I need you to pretend that I'm the 
owner of this place, just for today!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.320
Why, though? Lying is bad.

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:30.450
Please, I'm begging you!

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.420
But why? What's the reason?

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:33.300
The reason is...

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:36.410
Excuse me... <i>What</i> are you two talking about?

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:38.810
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:41.340
You came all this way, so why not 
come in and have something to eat?

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:42.120
What?!

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:44.870
Is that really all right?

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:47.800
I was just telling her to show you the place.

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:51.090
Oh, sorry for the bother when you're closed.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:53.420
What? We're not closed today. We're op—

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:55.520
Please, just shut up!

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:04.600
I've never been in such a 
low-brow restaurant before,

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:07.360
but the interior is quite charming.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.610
It certainly is.

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:11.470
Hy-chan, please take her drink order.

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:16.910
Did she... just give 
the Great Jahy a command?

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:19.790
She didn't, she didn't! 
She didn't do nothing!

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:23.360
I told her before that 
she should stay out of it

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:25.670
because I would personally take your order.

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.790
What an absolute honor!

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.120
Then I'll take a draft beer...

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:31.800
One draft beer!

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:33.410
<i>This is so exhausting.</i>

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:36.630
Here's your draft beer and a snack.

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:40.250
The Great Jahy brought this just for me!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.640
Thank you so much!
I'm most looking forward to this.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.640
Your Greatness...

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:59.480
You know, I've sampled many dishes 
since coming to the human world,

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:05.920
but what you brought me is the 
most delicious thing I've ever tasted!

00:17:06.650 --> 00:17:07.590
Druj...

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:16.430
Is that right? Then order up!
Today is my treat.

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.470
It would be my pleasure and delight.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.900
I recommend the fried chicken
 and the sweet omelet.

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:23.680
The seafood's good, too.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.140
It's so good!

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:28.610
So good!

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.320
This is good, too!

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:37.360
Your Greatness, these are all delicious!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:40.740
<i>This... isn't so bad.</i>

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:46.190
<i>Maybe hearing people talk
 like that is really why I work.</i>

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:49.210
Thank you for the food!

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:53.680
Your Greatness, that was an incredible meal.

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:56.290
I'm glad to hear that. 
You're welcome anytime.

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:57.080
Thank you!

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:11.440
Hy-chan.

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.650
Here's the bill.

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.070
Special offal stew

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.070
Total

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.070
Sales tax

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:17.070
Total items

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:22.680
I was surprised you offered to treat her.

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:25.610
This is three days' pay!

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:29.780
<i>She may have maintained her pride 
as the Dark Realm's second-in-command,</i>

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:33.190
<i>but the Great Jahy's wallet 
suffered a great blow!</i>

00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:39.330
She ate so much...

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:44.760
<b>The Great Space Pirate Jahy<i>!!</i></b>

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:42.760
<i>Space: the last remaining 
unclaimed holy ground.</i>

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:47.940
<i>Right now, a fierce battle is 
unfolding to take control of it!</i>

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:51.850
Fire the Dark Realm energy cannon!

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:04.900
Look at that, Druj! Now those 
are some pretty fireworks!

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.240
All hail the Great Jahy!

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:12.010
The cosmos belong to me, 
Great Space Pirate Jahy!

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:15.810
Indeed! You rule the universe!

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.250
<i>Or does she?</i>

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:26.930
It's... the landlord from 
Planet Craparment!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.920
<i>Space Pirate Jahy!</i>

00:21:28.920 --> 00:21:32.000
<i>I'm here to collect the rental fee on 
your ship, and today you will pay!</i>

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:35.730
How dare you spew this nonsense?!

00:21:35.730 --> 00:21:37.510
There, there, Druj.

00:21:38.090 --> 00:21:39.630
What <i>are</i> you talking about?

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:43.020
This is certifiably <i>my</i> battleship.

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:45.860
Trying to pull a fast one on me now?

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:50.120
It takes gall to be that brazen when you're
 months and months behind on payments!

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:52.220
<i>Pay up!</i>

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:55.120
Look, Druj. Space is beautiful today.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.270
It truly is, Your Greatness.

00:21:57.270 --> 00:21:59.340
Well, let's go home and get something to eat.

00:21:59.340 --> 00:22:03.050
I was thinking we should have 
omelet rice tonight, Dark Realm style.

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:05.230
<i>Hey, that sounds good.</i>

00:22:05.230 --> 00:22:07.300
All right, I've had about enough!

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:09.630
Prepare the energy cannon!

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:13.980
Druj, warp!

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:14.740
Aye!

00:22:14.970 --> 00:22:16.680
You're not getting away!

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:26.620
Excellent helmsmanship!

00:22:26.620 --> 00:22:28.030
You honor me!

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:32.640
Damn, the fact that it's my 
battleship made me hesitate...

00:22:32.640 --> 00:22:33.810
But not again!

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:35.370
I won't miss this time!

00:22:39.240 --> 00:22:43.450
This is bad! The previous attack 
damaged the warp system!

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:44.630
What?

00:22:44.900 --> 00:22:48.050
Warp drive offline! Warp drive offline!

00:22:48.590 --> 00:22:50.800
It's coming! Return fire!

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:51.680
Aye!

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.020
Another shot!

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:01.730
That's my line!

00:23:08.920 --> 00:23:11.740
<i>Stop this at once!</i>

00:23:16.530 --> 00:23:18.230
What?!

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:20.820
That's...

00:23:23.270 --> 00:23:25.550
The space police!

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:34.010
<b>To be continued?!</b>

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:39.020
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:39.020
<b>Saurva Never Slips Up?</b>
